# macOS
.DS_Store

# Terraform
**/.terraform/
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/*.tfvars
!**/*.tfvars.example

# Ansible/Kubespray artifacts
**/*.retry
**/inventory/**/artifacts/
**/inventory/**/credentials/

# Kubeconfigs
**/admin.conf
**/*.kubeconfig
**/.kube/
**/kubeconfig/

# Secrets (commit templates only)
**/*secret*.yaml
!**/*secret-template*.yaml
!**/*.secret-template.yaml
